# act (https://github.com/nektos/act) runs .github/workflows/dotnet.yml locally
# in Docker. The default "micro" runner images act ships are too bare (no
# Node.js, no docker CLI) for this workflow's composite action and Docker
# build step, so pin the fuller image here instead of requiring -P every time.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
